{"id":"93165ca56749f325","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-primitive-recursive-presentations.md","title":"Primitive Recursive Descriptions","display":"df-primitive-recursive-presentations — Primitive Recursive Descriptions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-primitive-recursive-presentations","aliases":["90-df-primitive-recursive-presentations"],"display":"df-primitive-recursive-presentations — Primitive Recursive Descriptions","depends_on":["[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[90-df-composition-operator]]","[[90-df-primrec-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-primitive-recursive-presentations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-primitive-recursive-presentations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primitive-recursive-presentations — Primitive Recursive Descriptions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1fd3a0e014d33285\" href=\"?note=1fd3a0e014d33285\" title=\"90-df-composition-operator\">90-df-composition-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ac2460aba5c368e5\" href=\"?note=ac2460aba5c368e5\" title=\"90-df-primrec-operator\">90-df-primrec-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,\\mathrm{PR},Z,S,\\pi_i^k\">\\(\\mathcal F,\\mathrm{PR},Z,S,\\pi_i^k\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp},\\operatorname{PrimRec}\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp},\\operatorname{PrimRec}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1fd3a0e014d33285\" href=\"?note=1fd3a0e014d33285\" title=\"90-df-composition-operator\">90-df-composition-operator</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ac2460aba5c368e5\" href=\"?note=ac2460aba5c368e5\" title=\"90-df-primrec-operator\">90-df-primrec-operator</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z^*,S^*,\\Pi_{i,k}^*,C(d,e_1,\\ldots,e_m),R(d,e)\">\\(Z^*,S^*,\\Pi_{i,k}^*,C(d,e_1,\\ldots,e_m),R(d,e)\\)</span> 是带互异标签的有限描述树构造子；构造子单射、各标签的像互不相交，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\le i\\le k\">\\(1\\le i\\le k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\\ge1\">\\(m,k\\ge1\\)</span>。这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,R\">\\(C,R\\)</span> 的参数是描述树，不是上游函数图上的总化算子。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal J_n\">\\(\\mathcal J_n\\)</span> 是下式按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 定义的“描述—元数—函数图”关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}},a,\\llbracket\\cdot\\rrbracket\">\\(\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}},a,\\llbracket\\cdot\\rrbracket\\)</span> 分别是其描述域、元数函数与解释函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal J_0&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(Z^*,1,Z),(S^*,1,S)\\}\\cup\n\\{(\\Pi_{i,k}^*,k,\\pi_i^k):k\\ge1\\land1\\le i\\le k\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal J_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal J_n\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{(C(d,e_1,\\ldots,e_m),k,\\operatorname{Comp}(f,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)):\nm,k\\ge1\\land(d,m,f)\\in\\mathcal J_n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24em}\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\ (e_i,k,h_i)\\in\\mathcal J_n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{(R(d,e),k+1,\\operatorname{PrimRec}(f,h)):\nk\\ge1\\land(d,k,f)\\in\\mathcal J_n\\land(e,k+2,h)\\in\\mathcal J_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal J&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal J_n,\\\\\n\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{d:\\exists k\\ge1\\ \\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\ (d,k,f)\\in\\mathcal J\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall d\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\ \\exists!(k,f)\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\times\\mathcal F\\\n(d,k,f)\\in\\mathcal J,\\\\\na&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(d,k):\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\ (d,k,f)\\in\\mathcal J\\},\\\\\n\\llbracket\\cdot\\rrbracket&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(d,f):\\exists k\\ge1\\ (d,k,f)\\in\\mathcal J\\},\\\\\na&amp;:\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\qquad\n\\llbracket\\cdot\\rrbracket:\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\to\\mathcal F,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall d\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\quad\\llbracket d\\rrbracket\\in\\mathrm{PR}_{a(d)},\\\\\n&amp;\\{\\llbracket d\\rrbracket:d\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\}=\\mathrm{PR}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal J_0&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(Z^*,1,Z),(S^*,1,S)\\}\\cup\n\\{(\\Pi_{i,k}^*,k,\\pi_i^k):k\\ge1\\land1\\le i\\le k\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal J_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal J_n\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{(C(d,e_1,\\ldots,e_m),k,\\operatorname{Comp}(f,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)):\nm,k\\ge1\\land(d,m,f)\\in\\mathcal J_n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24em}\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\ (e_i,k,h_i)\\in\\mathcal J_n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{(R(d,e),k+1,\\operatorname{PrimRec}(f,h)):\nk\\ge1\\land(d,k,f)\\in\\mathcal J_n\\land(e,k+2,h)\\in\\mathcal J_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal J&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal J_n,\\\\\n\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{d:\\exists k\\ge1\\ \\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\ (d,k,f)\\in\\mathcal J\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall d\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\ \\exists!(k,f)\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\times\\mathcal F\\\n(d,k,f)\\in\\mathcal J,\\\\\na&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(d,k):\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\ (d,k,f)\\in\\mathcal J\\},\\\\\n\\llbracket\\cdot\\rrbracket&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(d,f):\\exists k\\ge1\\ (d,k,f)\\in\\mathcal J\\},\\\\\na&amp;:\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\qquad\n\\llbracket\\cdot\\rrbracket:\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\to\\mathcal F,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall d\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\quad\\llbracket d\\rrbracket\\in\\mathrm{PR}_{a(d)},\\\\\n&amp;\\{\\llbracket d\\rrbracket:d\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\}=\\mathrm{PR}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>描述树可有效检验；不同描述允许表示同一外延函数，不要求判定两段原始递归程序是否外延相等。最后的等式由描述树归纳与最小闭包的两向包含证明。这一语法呈示用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PRA\">\\(PRA\\)</span> 的函数符号和定义方程，而不是新增另一种递归函数类。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"abc082683aa1de80","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"1fd3a0e014d33285","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-composition-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-primrec-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ac2460aba5c368e5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-primrec-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"abc082683aa1de80","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F,\\mathrm{PR},Z,S,\\pi_i^k$ 取 [[90-df-primitive-recursive]]；$\\operatorname{Comp},\\operatorname{PrimRec}$ 取 [[90-df-composition-operator]]、[[90-df-primrec-operator]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"1fd3a0e014d33285","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F,\\mathrm{PR},Z,S,\\pi_i^k$ 取 [[90-df-primitive-recursive]]；$\\operatorname{Comp},\\operatorname{PrimRec}$ 取 [[90-df-composition-operator]]、[[90-df-primrec-operator]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-primrec-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ac2460aba5c368e5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F,\\mathrm{PR},Z,S,\\pi_i^k$ 取 [[90-df-primitive-recursive]]；$\\operatorname{Comp},\\operatorname{PrimRec}$ 取 [[90-df-composition-operator]]、[[90-df-primrec-operator]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F,\\mathrm{PR},Z,S,\\pi_i^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp},\\operatorname{PrimRec}","display":false},{"tex":"Z^*,S^*,\\Pi_{i,k}^*,C(d,e_1,\\ldots,e_m),R(d,e)","display":false},{"tex":"1\\le i\\le k","display":false},{"tex":"m,k\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"C,R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal J_n","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}},a,\\llbracket\\cdot\\rrbracket","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal J_0&\\coloneqq\n\\{(Z^*,1,Z),(S^*,1,S)\\}\\cup\n\\{(\\Pi_{i,k}^*,k,\\pi_i^k):k\\ge1\\land1\\le i\\le k\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal J_{n+1}&\\coloneqq\\mathcal J_n\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{(C(d,e_1,\\ldots,e_m),k,\\operatorname{Comp}(f,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)):\nm,k\\ge1\\land(d,m,f)\\in\\mathcal J_n\\\\\n&\\hspace{24em}\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\ (e_i,k,h_i)\\in\\mathcal J_n\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{(R(d,e),k+1,\\operatorname{PrimRec}(f,h)):\nk\\ge1\\land(d,k,f)\\in\\mathcal J_n\\land(e,k+2,h)\\in\\mathcal J_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal J&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal J_n,\\\\\n\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}&\\coloneqq\\{d:\\exists k\\ge1\\ \\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\ (d,k,f)\\in\\mathcal J\\},\\\\\n&\\forall d\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\ \\exists!(k,f)\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\times\\mathcal F\\\n(d,k,f)\\in\\mathcal J,\\\\\na&\\coloneqq\\{(d,k):\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\ (d,k,f)\\in\\mathcal J\\},\\\\\n\\llbracket\\cdot\\rrbracket&\\coloneqq\\{(d,f):\\exists k\\ge1\\ (d,k,f)\\in\\mathcal J\\},\\\\\na&:\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\to\\mathbb N_{>0},\\qquad\n\\llbracket\\cdot\\rrbracket:\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\to\\mathcal F,\\\\\n&\\forall d\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\quad\\llbracket d\\rrbracket\\in\\mathrm{PR}_{a(d)},\\\\\n&\\{\\llbracket d\\rrbracket:d\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\}=\\mathrm{PR}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"PRA","display":false}],"bytes":2716,"backlinks":[{"id":"62294d1c4025d5d8","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{PR}},a(d),\\llbracket d\\rrbracket$ 及描述构造子见 [[90-df-primitive-recursive-presentations]]；$L_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ 见 [[90-df-arithmetic-language]]。"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-primitive-recursive-presentations]]、[[90-df-pra]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[90-df-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-df-factorial-function.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point.md]]\n[[90-df-formula.md]]\n[